// Seki Senshi, ADR-0032: radio breaks, `radio_<station>_<n>`. App and audio play them as subtitles
// between tracks. No choices, no effects. Three stations:
// - drift: Neon Drift 88.1, synthwave all night, DJ Kass;
// - yoru: Yoru FM 76.5, Japanese city pop, Mama Yuki, who remembers when the sky was blue;
// - tessen: Tessen Info 24, the corporation's news, ads and reassurance.

=== radio_drift_1 ===
KASS: Neon Drift, eighty-eight point one. Kass here. It's three in the morning and you're still listening. Love you, you poor sleepless moths.
-> END

=== radio_drift_2 ===
KASS: Got a caller from Stare Miasto. Says a drinks machine started talking to him. Bro, talk back. Not many people listen these days.
-> END

=== radio_drift_3 ===
REKLAMA: Ripperdoc Neon Express! Implants in forty minutes or your money back! Money-back guarantee does not cover limbs.
-> END

=== radio_drift_4 ===
KASS: Next track's for everyone driving through the city at night with no idea where they're going. That's good. If you know, you've already arrived.
-> END

=== radio_drift_5 ===
KASS: Quick traffic update. That car from the blockade night is still parked on the viaduct over Tysiąclecia. Nobody came back for it. Maybe it's yours. Think about that over the synth.
-> END

=== radio_yoru_1 ===
YUKI: Konbanwa, good evening. Yoru FM, seventy-six point five. Mama Yuki at the mic, and tea at Mama's side.
-> END

=== radio_yoru_2 ===
YUKI: This song is from back when the sky over the Trybunał was blue. You don't remember? Me neither. But the song does.
-> END

=== radio_yoru_3 ===
REKLAMA: Ramen at Fumiko's on Podzamcze, by the bus station. Four in the afternoon to four in the morning. Broth simmered longer than your last relationship.
-> END

=== radio_yoru_4 ===
YUKI: A letter from a listener: "Mama Yuki, my boyfriend bought memories of our first date, because he lost his own." Sweetheart, at least he paid. Some people don't remember for free.
-> END

=== radio_yoru_5 ===
YUKI: Mei from KARAOKE asks me to remind you: from eight in the evening, three songs about broken hearts and one about a train. I recommend the train one.
-> END

=== radio_tessen_1 ===
LEKTORKA: Tessen Info 24. Nabrzeże Bystrzycy works without a break. Yesterday's riots by the warehouses turned out to be a drill. The drill went according to plan.
-> END

=== radio_tessen_2 ===
LEKTORKA: An announcement for employees. The shift optimization algorithm thanks everyone who is no longer optimal. Your contribution will be remembered by the system for thirty days.
-> END

=== radio_tessen_3 ===
REKLAMA: Tessen Security. Your peace of mind is our service. Your safety is our premium service. Ask about the family plan.
-> END

=== radio_tessen_4 ===
LEKTORKA: Weather. Fog over Zalew Zemborzycki, acid rain over the city, and over Tessen, as always, clear skies. The board reminds you that company umbrellas are available at every office.
-> END

=== radio_tessen_5 ===
LEKTORKA: National news. Kagami Biotech denies rumors of memory buying on Krakowskie Przedmieście. Kagami stresses that it merely stores clients' memories, on their behalf and for a small fee.
-> END
